flowchart TB
accTitle: Durable acceptance and a single counted vote
accDescr: A queue acknowledgment precedes the accepted response, and a conditional write rejects repeated contest-and-voter records before tallying.
V["Authenticated voter"] --> API["Validate contest and voter identity"]
API --> Q[("SQS durable message")]
Q -->|Submission succeeds| ACK["Accepted for processing"]
Q --> W["Worker receives message"]
W --> C{"Atomic conditional PutItem result?"}
C -->|Inserted| D[("Unique vote committed")]
C -->|Record already exists| DUP["Duplicate: do not add vote"]
D --> DEL["Delete processed queue message"]
DUP --> DEL
D --> T["Tally after queue and failures reconcile"]
class V inputData
class Q,D storage
class C decision
class DUP warning
class ACK,T output
